OL,3,GNEWSA'Caring for dad was so emotionally
OL,4,Adraining but the hospice helped us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn south-west London, siblings Terri
OL,7,FHill and Will Simpson are visiting
OL,8,Ftheir father Bill, who began receiving
OL,9,Fpalliative care at St Raphael's hospice
OL,10,Fthe day before.
OL,12,FBill, 66, has health complications
OL,13,Ffollowing a heart attack in his 40s,
OL,14,Fand was being cared for at home by his
OL,15,Ffamily.
OL,17,F"It became really emotionally and
OL,18,Fphysically draining," said Will. "It's
OL,19,Fchanged so much from being in the house
OL,20,Fto being here, because they've looked
OL,21,Fafter him so well."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
