OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Caring for dad was so emotionally
OL,4,Adraining but the hospice helped us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hospice, like most others, is
OL,7,Ffinanced by the NHS and public
OL,8,Fdonations. It has called for a fairer
OL,9,Ffunding model, so that it can utilise
OL,10,Fits empty beds to care for more
OL,11,Fpatients with terminal illnesses.
